[en.FOCUS_C14_FRIEND_REPAY]
Repay Friendship with Friendship

[en.FOCUS_C14_FRIEND_REPAY_desc]
“If you’d come to me in friendship, then the scums who ruined your business would be suffering this very day. And if, by chance, an honest pony like yourself made enemies, then they would become my enemies. And then they would fear you. Someday, and that day may never come, I will call upon you to do a service for me. But until that day, accept this justice as a gift on family appreciation day.

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FRIEND_REPAY]
以德报德

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FRIEND_REPAY_desc]
“如果你以友谊来找我，那么毁了你生意的那些家伙今天就会受到惩罚。如果，偶然间，像你这样诚实的小马招惹了敌对者，那么他们就会成为我的敌对者。然后他们就会害怕你。总有一天，也许那一天永远不会到来，我会召唤你为我效劳。但在那一天到来之前，把这份正义当作家族感恩日的礼物吧。”

